{"overview":"دکستر مورگان از کما بیدار می‌شود و به سمت نیویورک سیتی حرکت می‌کند، مصمم است هریسون را پیدا کند و اوضاع را درست کند. اما وقتی آنجل باتیستا، مامور متروی میامی، با سوالاتی از راه می‌رسد، دکستر متوجه می‌شود که گذشته او به سرعت او را جلب می کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Dexter Morgan awakens from a coma to find Harrison gone without a trace. Realizing the weight of what he put his son through, Dexter sets out for New York City, determined to find him and make things right. But closure won't come easy. When Miami Metro's Angel Batista arrives with questions, Dexter realizes his past is catching up to him fast. As father and son navigate their own darkness in the city that never sleeps, they soon find themselves deeper than they ever imagined - and that the only way out is together.","tagline_en":"Back and sharper than ever.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":3,"y":2026,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2025,"poster":"/oE51dszCO3IifSAb4unn7rgoNUH.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2026,"poster":"/o2Oyi3boT100bY5kCP4MBiTeetO.jpg"}],"episodes":20,"crew":["کلاید فیلیپس"],"crew_en":["Clyde Phillips"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"مایکل سی هال","role":"Dexter Morgan","photo":"/7zUMGoujuev5PUwwv4Gl6ikB50k.jpg","en":"Michael C. Hall"},{"name":"اوما تورمن","role":"Charley Brown","photo":"/sBgAZWi3o4FsnaTvnTNtK6jpQcF.jpg","en":"Uma Thurman"},{"name":"Jack Alcott","role":"Harrison Morgan","photo":"/65KEuv3LIBEaeIkqhyps6heZ9aa.jpg"},{"name":"Ntare Guma Mbaho Mwine","role":"Blessing Kamara","photo":"/nmwMBGmrqVgeAOdWJJJJi9A2l7C.jpg"},{"name":"Kadia Saraf","role":"Claudette Wallace","photo":"/lHaOGTMcq4SQeaHxC2BSeAwony9.jpg"},{"name":"Dominic Fumusa","role":"Melvin Oliva","photo":"/1wgHvqNM0LisAhkInYDD9JIGPJ0.jpg"},{"name":"جیمز رمار","role":"Harry Morgan","photo":"/ctMVpFDKKWCty60lLORf3IoJcv9.jpg","en":"James Remar"},{"name":"برایان کاکس","role":"The New York Ripper","photo":"/scSjbFCTRngXlkJRoK